    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53592" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάσεν</span></b>  (indecl. ?), 
			Lacon.
		 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάσις</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάσιος</span> (v. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάσιοι</span>), denotes relationship of a Spartan boy to the
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βουαγός </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγελάρχης</span>) of his class (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγέλη</span>): usu. c. dat., <i><span class="en">
			<u>IG</u>
			5(1).60
		</span></i>, al., but c. gen., ib.<i><span class="en">
			298
		</span></i>.</div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
